# Standard BF callable AArch64 native word position ledger
# All accepted source commands advance the full sixty four bit count
# Open bracket is fourteen words and close bracket is eight words
# Bracket tags expose eight byte unsigned absolute word positions
# Final wide word length and overflow status end the ledger stream
